#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068523 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "da0ca17e-50f3-5f67-bb1c-27868f7b4f45" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing a Cubic Polynomial by a Quadratic Polynomial"}] :question/id #uuid "a2aac357-23c5-5038-84c6-bc263bd45afa" :question/math-academy-id "e-5143" :question/problem "Determine the quotient and remainder of $6x^3-x^2+3x+1$ divided by $3x^2+x+2$." :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n3x^{2} + x + 22x - 1; 3x^{2} + x + 26x^{3} - 0x^{2} + 3x + 1; 3x^{2} + x + 26x^{3} + 2x^{2} + 4x_(―); 3x^{2} + x + 26x^{3} - 3x^{2} - 0x + 1; 3x^{2} + x + 26x^{3}- 3x^{2} - 0x - 2_(―); 3x^{2} + x + 26x^{3} - 3x^{2} - x +3\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n- the quotient is ${\\color{blue}2x-1}$, and\n- the remainder is ${\\color{red}3}$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068524 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "525be9c7-af11-506b-be69-444dfc640add" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing Polynomials When the Dividend Contains Zero Coefficients"}] :question/id #uuid "bd9a160c-574e-506e-865c-d08061c75aed" :question/math-academy-id "e-5144" :question/problem "Find the quotient and remainder of the following division problem:\n\n$\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x + 8}{x^2 - 1}$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the dividend is missing the $x^3$ term. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing term with a coefficient of zero, as follows:\n\n$$\n2x^4-7x^2-x+8 = 2x^4+{\\color{red}0}x^3-7x^2-x+8\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\nx^{2} - 12x^{2} - 5; x^{2} - 12x^{4} + 0x^{3} - 7x^{2} - 0x + 8; x^{2} - 12x^{4} + 0x^{3} - 2x^{2}_(―); x^{2} - 12x^{4} + 0x^{3} - 5x^{2} - 0x + 8; x^{2} - 12x^{4} + 0x^{3}- 5x^{2} + 0x + 5_(―); x^{2} - 12x^{4} + 0x^{3} - 5x^{2}- 0x + 3\n$$\n\nAs a result,\n\n- the quotient is ${2x^2 - 5}$, and\n- the remainder is ${-x+3}$.\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x +8}{x^2 - 1} = 2x^2-5 + \\dfrac{-x+3}{x^2-1}\n$$\n\nWe can rewrite this result as follows:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x +8}{x^2 - 1} = 2x^2-5 - \\dfrac{x-3}{x^2-1}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068584 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "76a7314b-4ebf-52eb-b464-97865ea9a81e" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing a Quartic Polynomial by a Quadratic or Cubic Polynomial"}] :question/id #uuid "9438b41b-2ad4-5248-881c-cb938b6cf1c3" :question/math-academy-id "e-8932" :question/problem "Find the quotient and remainder of the following division problem:\n$\\dfrac {5x^4- 2x^3 - 18x^2 + 11x - 13} {5x^2-2x+2}$" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n5x^{2} - 2x + 2x^{2} - 4; 5x^{2} - 2x + 25x^{4} - 2x^{3} - 18x^{2} + 11x - 13; 5x^{2} - 2x + 25x^{4} - 2x^{3} + 02x^{2}_(―); 5x^{2} - 2x + 25x^{4} - 2x^{3} - 20x^{2} + 11x - 13; 5x^{2} - 2x + 25x^{4} - 2x^{3}- 20x^{2} + 08x - 08_(―); 5x^{2} - 2x + 25x^{4} - 2x^{3} - 20x^{2} +03x - 05\n$$\n\nAs a result,\n\n- the quotient is $x^2-4$, and\n- the remainder is $3x-5$.\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{5x^4-2x^3-18x^2+11x-13}{5x^2-2x+2}=x^2-4 + \\dfrac{3x-5}{5x^2-2x+2}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068936 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "76a7314b-4ebf-52eb-b464-97865ea9a81e" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing a Quartic Polynomial by a Quadratic or Cubic Polynomial"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "82b57ecf-a5fb-57e8-b802-bf67f5253756" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4x^{2} + 1 + \\frac{3x - 1}{2x^{2} - x + 2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186065411} {:answer/id #uuid "a173c468-dbc8-57ee-8270-a66ee26e9692" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4x^{2} - 1 + \\frac{3x - 1}{2x^{2} - x + 2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186065412} {:answer/id #uuid "c0773acb-426a-5b0a-b883-fd1f7f2f7036" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3x - 1 + \\frac{4x^{2} + 1}{2x^{2} - x + 2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186065413} {:answer/id #uuid "08bafa7e-9068-500c-acf7-264102a89af9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4x^{2} - 1 + \\frac{2x^{2} - x + 2}{3x - 1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186065414} {:answer/id #uuid "7b415429-d660-59d4-a002-d4e38d89bcd6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4x^{2} + 1 - \\frac{3x - 1}{2x^{2} - x + 2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186065415}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a173c468-dbc8-57ee-8270-a66ee26e9692" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4x^{2} - 1 + \\frac{3x - 1}{2x^{2} - x + 2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186065412} :answer-field/id #uuid "248bd689-ca1c-54bb-b269-332d7fdf62d6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186065410}] :question/id #uuid "09328db2-5806-5fcc-a4c6-db8151537223" :question/math-academy-id "q-104257" :question/problem "What is $\\frac{8x^{4} - 4x^{3} + 6x^{2} + 4x - 3}{2x^{2} - x + 2}$?"}]}
